#: manual/api/differentiation.md:29
msgid "**Description:** Evaluates `function` at the nodes and returns the weighted sum. Returns `None` if `nodes` and `weights` differ in length."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:34
msgid "**Description:** Estimates the first derivative at `point` by Ridders' method: central differences with the step divided by 1.4 at every level, extrapolated in a Richardson tableau."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:37
#: manual/api/integration.md:19
#: manual/api/integration.md:40
#: manual/api/legacy_deriv.md:10
#: manual/api/legacy_deriv.md:44
