#: manual/api/power_series.md:20
msgid "**Description:** Builds the Taylor polynomial about a point from an oracle for the derivatives at that point: the coefficient of `x^k` is `derivative(k) / k!`. Each division uses the supplied arithmetic context. Negative `order` is a domain error."
